From 7d7c542ce763a215594ecaee72905438736af889 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:23:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): do not hold active_pr on another card's pull
 [daveey]

A comment that only names another live card's completion_contract, or
that only says the pull does not block this card, is not duplicate-PR
evidence. This card's own pull still holds. The hold notice reads checks
with the same gh argv as pr_state, so a broker-readable pull with zero
failing checks is not reported as unavailable. The fix card no longer
tells a dispatcher worker to unblock or schedule the held card.
